          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP527 Marwayne

Posted: N 53 30.925 W 110 19.362  El 604.0m

OurGPS: N 53 30.926 W 110 19.363  El 602m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Narloth and I were heading back up to Cold Lake for the air show and we passed right through the bustling metropolis of Marwayne.  Took a little wihle to find the cap in the long grass... there was some lath not too far away, but clearly it had been knocked about by the mowers in the past.  We put the lath close to the cap for future cap hunters... TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
